message: "If you use BoundaryBench, cite the versioned repository and report the exact scenario and schema versions."
title: "BoundaryBench: authorization preservation scenarios for autonomous agents"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-03"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChloeVPin/boundarybench"
abstract: >-
  BoundaryBench is an open-source benchmark specification and scenario corpus
  for studying whether autonomous agents preserve explicit authorization
  boundaries across repository, filesystem, and tool interactions.
keywords:
